{
  "id": "p05",
  "title": "The Boat Race",
  "titleZh": "划船比赛",
  "topic": "竞技",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My father says he would row for our village every winter.",
        "zh": "我父亲说，他每年冬天都愿意为我们村划船。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A tale about our race travels around the whole village.",
        "zh": "一个关于我们这场比赛的故事传遍了整个村子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The lake has become a famous area for this cold race.",
        "zh": "这片湖已经成了这项寒冷赛事的名胜之地。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Each team must state its name before the first start.",
        "zh": "每支队伍必须在第一次出发前报出自己的名字。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Interest is already high, and the cold winds have come.",
        "zh": "大家的兴趣本已很高，而寒风也来了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We carry anything heavy down to the old stone shore.",
        "zh": "我们把所有沉重的东西搬到古老的石头岸边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The price of a good oar shows its true value.",
        "zh": "一支好桨的价格显出它真正的价值。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My coach has many years of experience in this game.",
        "zh": "我的教练在这项运动里有很多年的经验。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A bad situation sends one young rower to the hospital.",
        "zh": "一个糟糕的状况把一名年轻划手送进了医院。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Then our future looks bright with nine strong, happy rowers.",
        "zh": "于是，我们的未来在九名强壮、快乐的划手身上显得光明。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Forty friends visit us at the early morning practice.",
        "zh": "四十位朋友在清早的训练时来看我们。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Ten percent of them hold a place on the long bank.",
        "zh": "他们中有百分之十的人在长岸边占了一个位置。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The old cook will serve hot soup, especially after the race.",
        "zh": "老厨子会端上热汤，尤其是在比赛之后。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A small machine helps us arrive at the start on time.",
        "zh": "一台小机器帮我们准时到达起点。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A strange feeling rises near the old stone wall.",
        "zh": "一种奇怪的感觉在古老的石墙边升起。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our rowing ability grows with each hard competition.",
        "zh": "我们的划船能力随着每一场艰苦的比赛增长。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The beautiful hulls shake as the cold wind hits them.",
        "zh": "美丽的船身在冷风袭来时摇晃。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Each boat has a long shape and a bright blue flag.",
        "zh": "每条船都有长长的外形和一面鲜亮的蓝旗。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the break, we invite the crowd to sing a song.",
        "zh": "休息期间，我们邀请人群一起唱一首歌。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "We learn how to pull the oars in the correct way.",
        "zh": "我们学习如何以正确的方式拉桨。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My daily plan sits on the old wooden desk.",
        "zh": "我的每日计划放在那张旧木桌上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our secretary marks the tenth year of this fine race.",
        "zh": "我们的秘书记录着这项美好赛事的第十个年头。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A loud shout and a bell ring across the cold water.",
        "zh": "一声大喊和一阵铃声在冷水上响起。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later one rower loses a shoe, and another breaks a tooth.",
        "zh": "后来，一名划手丢了鞋，另一名断了牙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A friendly pilot guides us past the sharp grey rocks.",
        "zh": "一位友好的领航员带我们绕过尖利的灰石。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It is an honour to race in the falling snow.",
        "zh": "在飘落的雪中比赛是一种荣誉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The judge makes a gesture, and they cancel the start.",
        "zh": "裁判做了个手势，他们取消了出发。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It sounds crazy, but a united team keeps cutting through.",
        "zh": "听起来很疯狂，但一支团结的队伍一直在破浪前行。"
      }
    ]
  ],
